<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN OLO EXCHANGE AUCTION TOTALS 40.59 BLN BFR.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN OLO EXCHANGE AUCTION TOTALS 40.59 BLN BFR.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its</p>
<p>linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 40.59</p>
<p>billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p> OLOs offered *		 amount sold (in bln bfr)</p>
<p>  13  code 264 7.00% 1999	  6.140</p>
<p>  25  code 285 5.00% 2001	  1.060</p>
<p>  19  code 273 6.50% 2005	 16.280</p>
<p>  26  code 286 6.25% 2007	 17.110</p>
<p>NOTE - * in exchange for 40.33 bln bfr of OLO lines 15 (6.75%</p>
<p>May 1997) and eight (9.25% August 1997).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
